# Communities that publish on bits.cern.ch, for the bits entry point; published
# by hand next to it as /cvmfs/bits.cern.ch/bits/etc/communities (see README.md).
# A community listed here gets --reuse-from cvmfs for its builds by default.
#
#   name          lower case; `bits-<name>` links and $BITS_COMMUNITY select it
#   repositories  comma-separated CVMFS repositories where a link named plain
#                 `bits` means this community (e.g. alice.cern.ch), or -
#   prefix        the community's CVMFS prefix (system: prefix in its recipes),
#                 whose <arch>/Modules/modulefiles bits q/enter/load use
#                 ($BITS_CVMFS_PREFIX), or - for none
#
# name     repositories   prefix
alice      -              -
atlas      -              /cvmfs/bits.cern.ch/atlas
cms        -              -
key4hep    -              /cvmfs/bits.cern.ch/key4hep
lcg        -              /cvmfs/bits.cern.ch/lcg
lhcb       -              /cvmfs/bits.cern.ch/lhcb
ship       -              /cvmfs/bits.cern.ch/ship
